{"overview":{"Symbol":"VG","Name":"Venture Global, Inc.","Description":"Venture Global, Inc., a liquefied natural gas (LNG) company, engages in the ownership, development, construction, and operation of LNG production facilities and associated infrastructure in the United States, Germany, France, Netherlands, the United Kingdom, and internationally.The company is involved in LNG production, natural gas transportation, and regasification operations, as well as LNG sales and shipping business through LNG tankers. Its LNG projects include Calcasieu, Plaquemines, and CP2 projects. The company was founded in 2013 and is headquartered in Arlington, Virginia. Venture Global, Inc. operates as a subsidiary of Venture Global Partners II, LLC.","CIK":"","Exchange":"NYSE","Currency":"USD","Country":"United States","Sector":"Energy","Industry":"Oil & Gas Midstream","Address":"1001 19th Street North, Arlington, VA, 22209, United States","FiscalYearEnd":"","LatestQuarter":"","MarketCapitalization":"34110236672","EBITDA":"6202999808","PERatio":"14.302083","PEGRatio":"0.8","BookValue":"2.913","DividendPerShare":"0.07","DividendYield":"0.0054","EPS":"0.96","RevenuePerShareTTM":"6.337","ProfitMargin":"0.18049999","OperatingMarginTTM":"0.25027","ReturnOnAssetsTTM":"0.06447","ReturnOnEquityTTM":"0.25521","RevenueTTM":"15473999872","GrossProfitTTM":"6835999744","DilutedEPSTTM":"0.96","QuarterlyEarningsGrowthYOY":"0.191","QuarterlyRevenueGrowthYOY":"0.589","AnalystTargetPrice":"16.15789","TrailingPE":"14.302083","ForwardPE":"14.331642","PriceToSalesRatioTTM":"2.204358","PriceToBookRatio":"4.7133536","EVToRevenue":"4.787","EVToEBITDA":"11.943","Beta":"","52WeekHigh":"19.5","52WeekLow":"5.72","50DayMovingAverage":"13.0526","200DayMovingAverage":"10.8941","SharesOutstanding":"515753572","DividendDate":"","ExDividendDate":"","DebtToEquity":"304.504"},"daily":{"Meta Data":{"1. Information":"Daily Time Series (Yahoo Finance, shaped like Alpha Vantage)","2. Symbol":"VG","3. Last Refreshed":"2026